# November 21, 2026: a first scatter of places across Ontario, away from Kingston and the Rideau (which data_on_arlm.py
# holds): the Niagara Peninsula, Hamilton, Toronto, York Region, Caledon, Peterborough, Ottawa, Prescott, Lake Huron's
# shore, Chatham-Kent, Essex and the Sault. Region on, claimed with tools/choose.py --thinnest (Ontario had 20 places).
# Sources opened in this session: Wikipedia as raw text (tools/wiki_raw.py); Parks Canada site and hours pages; Ontario
# Parks and the Forks of the Credit management plan (ontario.ca); HistoricPlaces.ca; HMdb.org; the City of St.
# Catharines, Hamilton Civic Museums, the Huron County Museum, the Sharon Temple museum, the Ontario Heritage Trust and
# Evergreen's own pages. The Bytown Museum's site would not open; its hours are not checked.
